Modification notice, November 23, 2026
The downstream project provides a React and Astryx interface for Sub2API.
It packages selected modules from the upstream frontend/src tree under shared/,
uses local build paths, and replaces embedded provider artwork and the favicon.
The homepage includes four model provider icons from the LobeHub collection.

